00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:46.476
And all this is supported by a lot of data.

00:02:49.956 --> 00:02:55.796
Let me give you a bit more context on where we started our reporting.

00:02:55.836 --> 00:03:04.796
Foundations was built on SAP BW running on premise,
and it has served us well over the few decades.

00:03:05.556 --> 00:03:11.876
Over time, the business expanded and the volume
of data also has increased a lot.

00:03:12.876 --> 00:03:21.916
At the same time, the pace of decision
making also pick up in day to day operation.

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:30.556
When the business needed new insight,
it often takes time and sometimes require it involvement.

00:03:31.836 --> 00:03:36.796
At the same time, different teams working with different data views.

00:03:37.356 --> 00:03:40.636
