00:03:42.116 --> 00:03:46.956
So overall we have the foundation and

00:03:47.676 --> 00:03:54.596
but we saw actually there are opportunities
for us to improve how we are able to provide a more quick

00:03:54.596 --> 00:03:57.996
and consistent insights to our teams.

