00:04:07.236 --> 00:04:13.596
years of transactions across multiple
markets covering finance and our retailers.

00:04:14.556 --> 00:04:21.276
So we have our front end system,
the SAP ERP, supporting finance and operations.

00:04:21.876 --> 00:04:30.916
And on the other hand, we have our SPC POS systems that are actually
collecting all sales transactions across the network.

00:04:31.796 --> 00:04:36.916
